Instruction on how you created the tools isolation for this product.
Please include platform you installed on, where you installed it, what
you copied where, etc.:

Go to http://rtpgsa.ibm.com/projects/a/auiml/AuimlUpdate/site.xml and find the build you need.
   ex: features/com.ibm.auiml.toolkit.install_feature_8.1.0.1203070211.jar
Look at the feature.xml file inside the downloaded jar and check the plugin version (e.g. 8.1.0.1203070211)
Download the plugin with the above mentioned version from http://rtpgsa.ibm.com/projects/a/auiml/AuimlUpdate/plugins/
   ex: com.ibm.auiml.toolkit.install_8.1.0.1203070211.jar
Then you can download the correct plugin by using the info in that xml file:
   ex: http://rtpgsa.ibm.com/projects/a/auiml/AuimlUpdate/plugins/com.ibm.auiml.toolkit.install_8.1.0.1203070211.jar


